5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin by observing everyone's behavior. Since it's Day 0, we have no information, but we should be careful about who tries to lead too aggressively.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared of anyone! I'll find the werewolf no matter what. Let's just be honest with each other.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Yay, a game! This is so exciting! I hope we can all get along while we figure out who the bad guy is!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Excitement is fine, but logic is better. I'll be watching your reactions closely. Let's see who slips up first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. We should remain calm and gather as much information as possible before making any hasty decisions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, your enthusiasm is noted, but recklessness can be a tool for the werewolf. Try to stay focused.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I am focused! I'm just saying we shouldn't be timid. If someone is acting weird, we should call them out!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,@Takumi is so brave! But maybe we should just chat a bit more first? I want to know what everyone is thinking!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,Chatting is just a way to hide intentions. I'm more interested in the contradictions that will inevitably appear.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Let's maintain a balanced approach. We can be friendly, but we must keep our guard up.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
