31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We have no deaths yet, as expected. Does anyone have information they are willing to share, or is the Seer staying hidden?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"If the Seer knows something, just tell us! We can't find the werewolf if we're all keeping secrets!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I agree! It would be so much easier if we knew who was human. But I guess the Seer has to be careful, right?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,I have information. Mio is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minako,,"That was a very sudden and direct claim, Shion. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, if you are the Seer, revealing yourself this early is a risk, but it provides a clear target. @Mio, how do you respond?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Mio is the werewolf? No way, she's too cheerful! Shion, are you sure you didn't make a mistake?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Eh?! Me?! No way! Shion, why would you say that? I'm just a normal girl! This is a big misunderstanding!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"My divination is absolute. Your acting is mediocre at best, Mio.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minako,,"It is a bold claim. However, if Shion is the werewolf and Mio is a villager, he might be trying to frame her to gain trust.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako makes a valid point. However, the werewolf usually tries to blend in rather than make such a high-profile accusation on Day 1.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't like this! I want to believe Mio, but Shion sounds so sure of himself. This is confusing!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mio,,Please believe me! I'm not a werewolf! Shion is just being mean or he's lying to trick you all!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,Emotional appeals are the last refuge of the guilty. The fact remains: she is the werewolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minako,,"If we execute Mio and she is human, we lose a valuable member. But if we leave her, the werewolf stays.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Given the evidence provided by the claimed Seer, the most logical move is to trust the divination for now. I vote for Mio.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I still feel bad about it, but if Shion is really the Seer, we have to. I'll vote for Mio.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mio,,"No! This isn't fair! You're all being tricked! Please, just one more day!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,Your time is up.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will follow the majority to ensure the village's safety. I vote for Mio.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
